{"cultures":[{"id":"drakast","name":"Drakast","archetype":"Mountain-born","description":"The Drakast, the Peakfolk, are a towering people, thick-bodied and ponderous, ponderous yet unflagging, made for force rather than finesse. Stoic by nature, sharp-witted and given to questions, watchful and missing little, warm and easy among strangers; they hold that the mountain remembers every oath sworn upon it. They are carved, the old songs say, from the living roots of the mountains, and make their home among wind-scoured peaks above the cloud line. Strangest of all, they weigh half what their height promises.","physicalTraits":{"heightRange":[257,286],"weightRange":[175,264],"size":"huge"},"pawns":[{"id":"pawn-0","name":"Xara Jewelcrest","sex":"female","age":19,"height":264,"weight":190,"size":"huge","traits":["camel-bodied","pecking-beak","packmule","fast-hands","dusk-wary"]},{"id":"pawn-1","name":"Roderick Fireforge","sex":"male","age":23,"height":284,"weight":223,"size":"huge","traits":["camel-bodied","frost-loving","grower"]},{"id":"pawn-2","name":"Clay Valorheart","sex":"male","age":39,"height":273,"weight":175,"size":"huge","traits":["camel-bodied","hollow-boned","angler","leg-scar-serious","flat-footed"]},{"id":"pawn-3","name":"Uma Copperstone","sex":"female","age":23,"height":269,"weight":200,"size":"huge","traits":["camel-bodied","frost-loving","master-butcher","master-alchemist"]},{"id":"pawn-4","name":"Wilda Wildstorm","sex":"female","age":44,"height":277,"weight":226,"size":"huge","traits":["camel-bodied","hollow-boned","pitworker","cha-minus-1"]},{"id":"pawn-5","name":"Aria Driftwood","sex":"female","age":32,"height":283,"weight":233,"size":"huge","traits":["camel-bodied","hollow-boned"]},{"id":"pawn-6","name":"Celia Driftwood","sex":"female","age":29,"height":261,"weight":247,"size":"huge","traits":["camel-bodied","hollow-boned","hot-headed"]},{"id":"pawn-7","name":"Halvard Emberfall","sex":"male","age":22,"height":271,"weight":246,"size":"huge","traits":["camel-bodied","frost-loving"]},{"id":"pawn-8","name":"Sylvi Ironforge","sex":"female","age":31,"height":280,"weight":188,"size":"huge","traits":["camel-bodied","frost-loving","cook-hand","master-tinker"]},{"id":"pawn-9","name":"Tomas Emberfall","sex":"male","age":35,"height":283,"weight":187,"size":"huge","traits":["camel-bodied","pecking-beak","forager"]}]},{"id":"rynek","name":"Rynek","archetype":"Forest-kin","description":"The Rynek, the Greenwise, are a towering people, thick-bodied and ponderous, light and darting in motion, trading raw power for a deft and certain hand. Elusive by nature, clever and curious, watchful and missing little, persuasive of tongue and quick to befriend; they hold that every felled tree must be answered with a planted one. They are shaped, they hold, from sunlight caught in old leaves, and make their home among the deep evergreen forests. Unmatched upon the water; strangest of all, they lift their head at things no one else has heard yet.","physicalTraits":{"heightRange":[235,294],"weightRange":[175,256],"size":"huge"},"pawns":[{"id":"pawn-100","name":"Wren Starweaver","sex":"female","age":28,"height":239,"weight":243,"size":"huge","traits":["feathered","keen-senses","brewer","builder-hand","rough-tanner"]},{"id":"pawn-101","name":"Nova Fireforge","sex":"female","age":39,"height":280,"weight":180,"size":"huge","traits":["feathered","per-for-cha-3","master-cook","grower","leg-burn-serious"]},{"id":"pawn-102","name":"Clay Healingsong","sex":"male","age":45,"height":271,"weight":232,"size":"huge","traits":["feathered","webbed-limbs","fastidious"]},{"id":"pawn-103","name":"Pike Fireforge","sex":"male","age":40,"height":244,"weight":199,"size":"huge","traits":["feathered","keen-senses","smith-hand","soft-tread","gregarious","nearsighted","poison-pot"]},{"id":"pawn-104","name":"Frost Proudfoot","sex":"male","age":26,"height":242,"weight":238,"size":"huge","traits":["feathered","per-for-cha-3","arm-scar-minor"]},{"id":"pawn-105","name":"Thor