":"pawn-203","name":"Cael Quicksilver","sex":"male","age":27,"height":152,"weight":65,"size":"small","traits":["werewolf-heritage","moonlit-claws","packmule"]},{"id":"pawn-204","name":"Storm Goldleaf","sex":"male","age":37,"height":153,"weight":57,"size":"small","traits":["werewolf-heritage","moonlit-claws","cha-minus-3"]},{"id":"pawn-205","name":"Freya Emberfall","sex":"female","age":18,"height":150,"weight":65,"size":"small","traits":["werewolf-heritage","moonlit-claws","duelist"]},{"id":"pawn-206","name":"Tomas Driftwood","sex":"male","age":40,"height":149,"weight":69,"size":"small","traits":["werewolf-heritage","carnivores-gut","scholar"]},{"id":"pawn-207","name":"Doran Copperstone","sex":"male","age":25,"height":157,"weight":68,"size":"small","traits":["werewolf-heritage","feral-adrenaline","dead-weight"]},{"id":"pawn-208","name":"Pike Keenblade","sex":"male","age":40,"height":145,"weight":66,"size":"small","traits":["werewolf-heritage","carcass-hunger","forager","grower","one-footed","pox-marked"]},{"id":"pawn-209","name":"Finn Kindred","sex":"male","age":38,"height":140,"weight":69,"size":"small","traits":["werewolf-heritage","lunar-aggression","master-tinker","meticulous","bountiful-hand","rough-tanner"]}]},{"id":"rynock","name":"Rynock","archetype":"Sky-touched","description":"The Rynock, the Far-seeing, are short of stature, spare and economical of build, measured in every step, made to slip a blow rather than weather it. Dreaming by nature, keen and quick of mind, alert to every shift in the world around them; they hold that to understand is the only worship worth the name. They are born under an omen-sky and marked by it ever since, and make their home among the thin air of the upper ranges. Stranger still, they pluck coals from the fire bare-fingered.","physicalTraits":{"heightRange":[142,166],"weightRange":[55,70],"size":"small"},"pawns":[{"id":"pawn-300","name":"Aria Valorheart","sex":"female","age":40,"height":153,"weight":64,"size":"small","traits":