rst warm swamp, and make their home among reed-choked deltas and tidal fens. Strangest of all, there is a solid, planted heft to their every step.","physicalTraits":{"heightRange":[160,199],"weightRange":[70,104],"size":"medium"},"pawns":[{"id":"pawn-400","name":"Storm Thornfield","sex":"male","age":23,"height":161,"weight":85,"size":"medium","traits":["heavy-boned","int-per-plus-1","mastersmith","master-butcher"]},{"id":"pawn-401","name":"Wilda Ironforge","sex":"female","age":21,"height":160,"weight":92,"size":"medium","traits":["heavy-boned","feathered","master-fisher","master-feller","handy","head-burn-critical","septic-prone"]},{"id":"pawn-402","name":"Halvard Kindred","sex":"male","age":35,"height":175,"weight":91,"size":"medium","traits":["heavy-boned","feathered","tinker","ditcher","skinner","torso-burn-minor"]},{"id":"pawn-403","name":"Zara Ravenclaw","sex":"female","age":29,"height":178,"weight":84,"size":"medium","traits":["heavy-boned","str-dex-plus-1","builder-hand","field-surgeon","seam-waster","unsettling-presence"]},{"id":"pawn-404","name":"Storm Proudfoot","sex":"male","age":16,"height":182,"weight":79,"size":"medium","traits":["heavy-boned","feathered","master-cook","stiff-jointed","per-minus-5"]},{"id":"pawn-405","name":"Enna Littlewater","sex":"female","age":42,"height":186,"weight":104,"size":"medium","traits":["heavy-boned","str-dex-plus-1","con-int-minus-3"]},{"id":"pawn-406","name":"Maren Ravenclaw","sex":"female","age":31,"height":184,"weight":81,"size":"medium","traits":["heavy-boned","feathered","handy","quick-striking","master-alchemist"]},{"id":"pawn-407","name":"Enna Earthsong","sex":"female","age":31,"height":176,"weight":91,"size":"medium","traits":["heavy-boned","str-dex-plus-1","master-cook","nyctophobic"]},{"id":"pawn-408","name":"Storm Clearwater","sex":"male","age":44,"height":174,"weight":112,"size":"medium","traits":["heavy-boned","int-per-plus-1","con-str-minus-3"]},{"id":"pawn-409","name":"Jax Lightbringer","sex":"male","age":17,"height":175,"weight":112,"size":"medium","traits":["heavy-boned","str-dex-plus-1","curious"]}]},{"id":"vexast","name":"Vexast","archetype":"Tundra-clans","description":"The Vexast, the White-wanderers, are a folk of middling height, thickset and solid, measured in every step, built for endurance far more than for speed. Loyal by nature, slow to abstraction, but cunning where it counts, alert to every shift in the world around them, persuasive of tongue and quick to befriend; they hold that the cold is an honest enemy, unlike folk. They are the last folk standing after the ice took all the rest, and make their home among the endless white of the far north. Foragers who let no growing thing go to waste; strangest of all, they walk out INTO weather other folk bar the door against.","physicalTraits":{"heightRange":[152,191],"weightRange":[64,119],"size":"medium"},"pawns":[{"id":"pawn-500","name":"Mira Blackwood","sex":"female","age":28,"height":156,"weight":115,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","gloomwise"]},{"id":"pawn-501","name":"Knox Ironback","sex":"male","age":22,"height":185,"weight":73,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","gloomwise","slapdash","arm-burn-minor"]},{"id":"pawn-502","name":"Yuki Underhill","sex":"female","age":31,"height":191,"weight":113,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","storm-fed","gregarious","pitworker"]},{"id":"pawn-503","name":"Sylvi Kindred","sex":"female","age":20,"height":167,"weight":117,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","gloomwise","scarred","master-cook","master-builder","arm-frostbite-minor"]},{"id":"pawn-504","name":"Halvard Underhill","sex":"male","age":17,"height":162,"weight":107,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","str-for-dex-1","forager"]},{"id":"pawn-505","name":"Axel Proudfoot","sex":"male","age":18,"height":175,"weight":112,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","str-for-dex-1","field-surgeon","lumbering-fighter"]},{"id":"pawn-506","name":"Jax Frostborn","sex":"male","age":28,"height":166,"weight":119,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","gloomwise","hot-headed","porter","per-minus-3"]},{"id":"pawn-507","name":"Sylvi Ironback","sex":"female","age":28,"height":181,"weight":64,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","storm-fed","nurturing","master-alchemist","light-footed","slow-spade","head-frostbite-minor"]},{"id":"pawn-508","name":"Celia Jewelcrest","sex":"female","age":42,"height":174,"weight":93,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","gloomwise","forager","savant","ravenous"]},{"id":"pawn-509","name":"Uma Frostborn","sex":"female","age":18,"height":169,"weight":106,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","storm-fed"]}]},{"id":"drakex","name":"Drakex","archetype":"Ember-kin","description":"The Drakex, the Ashborn, are a folk of middling height, sturdily built, measured in every step, all power where others have polish. Proud by nature, keen and quick of mind, inattentive to the small details; they hold that a cold forge is a kind of death. They are forged, the smiths say, in the heart of a mountain's fire, and make their home among volcanic slopes and forge-cities. Stranger still, their bite leaves a numb, spreading ache.","physicalTraits":{"heightRange":[175,198],"weightRange":[88,106],"size":"medium"},"pawns":[{"id":"pawn-600","name":"Nova Lightbringer","sex":"female","age":29,"height":187,"weight":98,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","str-for-int-3","cha-int-minus-3","point-blank"]},{"id":"pawn-601","name":"Gage Clearwater","sex":"male","age":44,"height":197,"weight":92,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","cha-int-plus-1","curious","meticulous","short-winded"]},{"id":"pawn-602","name":"Yuki Proudfoot","sex":"female","age":25,"height":198,"weight":105,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","mild-venom","one-legged"]},{"id":"pawn-603","name":"Petra Graymane","sex":"female","age":30,"height":179,"weight":100,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","cha-int-plus-1","arm-scar-critical"]},{"id":"pawn-604","name":"Xara Lightbringer","sex":"female","age":37,"height":181,"weight":95,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","cha-int-plus-1","grower","scholar","handy","dead-weight"]},{"id":"pawn-605","name":"Ren Littlewater","sex":"male","age":39,"height":180,"weight":90,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","cha-int-plus-1","field-surgeon","master-tanner","missing-fingers"]},{"id":"pawn-606","name":"Dain Jewelcrest","sex":"male","age":43,"height":197,"weight":103,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","str-for-int-3","torpid-blood","con-int-minus-5"]},{"id":"pawn-607","name":"Clay Keenblade","sex":"male","age":19,"height":183,"weight":92,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","cha-int-plus-1","quick-striking","soft-tread"]},{"id":"pawn-608","name":"Axel Copperstone","sex":"male","age":27,"height":176,"weight":104,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","mild-venom","builder-hand","scholar","forager","frostbrittle"]},{"id":"pawn-609","name":"Finn Driftwood","sex":"male","age":37,"height":185,"weight":97,"size":"medium","traits":["con-str-plus-1","str-for-int-3","grower","scholar","cha-int-minus-5","unsteady-hands"]}]},{"id":"zephix","name":"Zephix","archetype":"River-people","description":"The Zephix, the Bright-watered, are a tiny folk easily overlooked, whip-thin, light and darting in motion, trading raw power for a deft and certain hand. Genial by nature, of a shrewd, practical turn of mind, warm and easy among strangers; they hold that all things, like water, are meant to move and be shared. They are born where the great rivers braid, and never far from running water since, and make their home among fertile river valleys and trade-deltas. Stranger still, they stand so still that birds land on them.","physicalTraits":{"heightRange":[88,150],"weightRange":[35,60],"size":"tiny"},"pawns":[{"id":"pawn-700","name":"Storm Ashbrook","sex":"male","age":41,"height":136,"weight":73,"size":"tiny","traits":["stoneblood-heritage","quarried-bones","skinner"]},