ngue and quick to befriend; they hold that a debt of water is never forgotten. They are the get of the open road, owning nothing they cannot carry, and make their home among the trackless desert and dry steppe. Foragers who let no growing thing go to waste; strangest of all, their toes end in curved raptor hooks.","physicalTraits":{"heightRange":[166,223],"weightRange":[72,111],"size":"medium"},"pawns":[{"id":"pawn-800","name":"Gage Underhill","sex":"male","age":40,"height":185,"weight":107,"size":"medium","traits":["con-plus-3","gloomwise"]},{"id":"pawn-801","name":"Cael Keenblade","sex":"male","age":42,"height":191,"weight":111,"size":"medium","traits":["con-plus-3","cha-plus-1"]},{"id":"pawn-802","name":"Enna Valorheart","sex":"female","age":36,"height":187,"weight":72,"size":"medium","traits":["con-plus-3","raking-talons","smith-hand"]},{"id":"pawn-803","name":"Aria Lightbringer","sex":"female","age":40,"height":223,"weight":107,"size":"medium","traits":["con-plus-3","cha-plus-1","arm-scar-critical"]},{"id":"pawn-804","name":"Enna Goldleaf","sex":"female","age":19,"height":184,"weight":103,"size":"medium","traits":["con-plus-3","gloomwise","per-minus-3","faint-hearted"]},{"id":"pawn-805","name":"Ren Wyvernheart","sex":"male","age":21,"height":184,"weight":105,"size":"medium","traits":["con-plus-3","cha-plus-1","master-digger","soft-tread"]},{"id":"pawn-806","name":"Storm Ironforge","sex":"male","age":42,"height":208,"weight":83,"size":"medium","traits":["con-plus-3","cha-plus-1","soft-tread","weak-gutted"]},{"id":"pawn-807","name":"Aldric Oakheart","sex":"male","age":18,"height":200,"weight":97,"size":"medium","traits":["con-plus-3","duskshroud","timberwright","master-tanner"]},{"id":"pawn-808","name":"Pike Ironforge","sex":"male","age":38,"height":176,"weight":82,"size":"medium","traits":["con-plus-3","gloomwise","arm-burn-serious","ponderous","rock-shy"]},{"id":"pawn-809","name":"Dain Proudfoot","sex":"male","age":43,"height":192,"weight":87,"size":"medium","t